{"overview":"دههٔ ۱۹۳۰ مأموران اطلاعاتی به باستان‌شناس و ماجراجوی آمريکايی، «اينديانا جونز» (فورد)،  می گويند که «هيتلر» در پی يافتن \"صندوق مقدس\"  گم شده است تا از آن برای مقاصد سلطه جويانه اش استفاده کند. آنان از «جونز» می خواهند تا صندوق را پيدا  و به آمريکا بياورد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When Dr. Indiana Jones – the tweed-suited professor who just happens to be a celebrated archaeologist – is hired by the government to locate the legendary Ark of the Covenant, he finds himself up against the entire Nazi regime.","tagline_en":"The return of the great adventure.","runtime":115,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["استیون اسپیلبرگ"],"crew_en":["Steven Spielberg"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"هریسون فورد","role":"Indiana Jones","photo":"/pjBMJVPpcZK23Vt1nzr1zEBTWrP.jpg","en":"Harrison Ford"},{"name":"Karen Allen","role":"Marion Ravenwood","photo":"/75yyZZyinCUcuK8pOSXnggmuiRp.jpg"},{"name":"پل فریمن","role":"Dr. René Belloq","photo":"/qrjgLfuNdXektuBwNL6onZBkbHw.jpg","en":"Paul Freeman"},{"name":"جان ریس-دیویس","role":"Sallah","photo":"/qpXl1YnqQsUKYEDm3BB2zK5wbhe.jpg","en":"John Rhys-Davies"},{"name":"Ronald Lacey","role":"Major Arnold Toht","photo":"/wrFU5EkxKIq0TpEBuKXzcRAld73.jpg"},{"name":"Wolf Kahler","role":"Colonel Dietrich","photo":"/znWaz8pJjV6iIPj4SuWNPt0PVn1.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Higgins","role":"Gobler","photo":"/97ldqHkMzAyGCZZGozJA7RGMpDN.jpg"},{"name":"Denholm Elliott","role":"Dr. Marcus Brody","photo":"/qqgkT4QMMUbiFztfcUVLPYRXAxD.jpg"},{"name":"آلفرد مولینا","role":"Satipo","photo":"/nJo91Czesn6z0d0pkfbDoVZY3sg.jpg","en":"Alfred Molina"},{"name":"Vic Tablian","role":"Barranca / Monkey Man","photo":"/5uEpB1Cg4kXzyLg0xSY7EdnEMeC.jpg"},{"name":"Don Fellows","role":"Col. Musgrove","photo":"/2HFUZr73tp5BSOs02Ev7pGoDUfE.jpg"},{"name":"William Hootkins","role":"Major Eaton","photo":"/dav2i86GN0UvYIyoTwQmGE8Nweg.jpg"}],"trailer":"0xQSIdSRlAk","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/85-raiders-of-the-lost-a